Package: tterminal
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Chamesss <chamesss@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: bash, libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24), libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 (>= 2.40)
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Chamesss/TTerminal
Description: Tidy Terminal - a lightweight, Hyprland-inspired bash terminal
 A small native window running bash on a pseudo-terminal, with a
 frosted, rounded frame and an animated gradient border. The terminal
 is rendered by xterm.js (WebGL) inside WebKitGTK.
